<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1329129049"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1442746276"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Ballet Mécanique"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="やくしまるえつこ / 砂原良徳"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Ballet Mécanique"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:46.000"><div begin="00:53.083" end="04:10.559"><p begin="00:53.083" end="00:56.315" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Show me something I've never seen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我见识从未目睹的奇景</span></p><p begin="00:57.014" end="01:00.689" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Like a river gleaming in the sun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">譬如阳光下波光粼粼的河川</span></p><p begin="01:01.492" end="01:07.187" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Or the sea and sky kissing on the horizon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或是海天在地平线上交融的吻</span></p><p begin="01:08.431" end="01:11.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">When I look out of my window<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当我望向窗外</span></p><p begin="01:12.121" end="01:16.225" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">All I ever see is cloudy grey skies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满目皆是阴沉的灰暗天空</span></p><p begin="01:16.561" end="01:19.974" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">And when you look into your mirror<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你凝视镜中倒影时</span></p><p begin="01:20.470" end="01:24.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">How d'you think you're ever gonna see me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你又怎能透过镜中看见我的身影</span></p><p begin="01:24.638" end="01:29.331" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Look into my eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请直视我的双眼</span></p><p begin="01:49.480" end="01:52.624" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Will somebody please tell me why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有谁能告诉我缘由</span></p><p begin="01:53.361" end="01:57.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Women look so easy telling lies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何女人说谎时如此从容</span></p><p begin="01:57.729" end="02:04.252" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Why a smiling face can't erase lonely eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何微笑无法遮掩眼中的孤寂</span></p><p begin="02:04.829" end="02:07.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">When I look out of my window<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当我望向窗外</span></p><p begin="02:08.483" end="02:12.553" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">All I ever see is cloudy grey skies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满目皆是阴沉的灰暗天空</span></p><p begin="02:12.914" end="02:16.236" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">And when you look into your mirror<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你凝视镜中倒影时</span></p><p begin="02:16.781" end="02:20.479" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">How d'you think you're ever gonna see me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你又怎能透过镜中看见我的身影</span></p><p begin="02:20.971" end="02:25.349" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Look into my eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请直视我的双眼</span></p><p begin="02:30.399" end="02:32.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">I don't know why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不明缘由</span></p><p begin="02:32.977" end="02:37.156" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">My face makes you laugh all the time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的面容总惹你发笑</span></p><p begin="02:38.772" end="02:41.139" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">But you're all I need<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你是我全部所需</span></p><p begin="02:41.344" end="02:45.957" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">You make my life so complete<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你令我的生命完整无缺</span></p><p begin="03:22.844" end="03:28.932" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">僕には始めと終わりがあるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的存在有始亦有终</span></p><p begin="03:31.175" end="03:37.467" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">こうして長い間空を見てる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">长久以来我如此凝望天际</span></p><p begin="03:39.486" end="03:45.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">音楽いつまでも続く音楽<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">音乐永恒持续流转不息</span></p><p begin="03:47.850" end="03:54.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">踊っている僕を君は見ている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">起舞的我正被你默默注视</span></p><p begin="03:56.152" end="04:02.338" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">僕には始めと終わりがあるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的存在有始亦有终</span></p><p begin="04:04.530" end="04:10.559" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">こうして長い間空を見てるs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">长久以来我如此凝望天际</span></p></div></body></tt>